window.products.push({"id":374081,"name":"Ice Cube Trays - Round Ice Trays With Lid for Freezer, Sphere Ice Cube Mold with Bin and Scoop,3 Pack Ice Ball Maker Mold, Making 99 Sphere Ice Cubes ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jk9iJKa2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Easy Ice Release】：This round ice cube trays are made of hard plastic which makes round ice cube easier to release than silicone ice cube mold. let it sit for 5 minutes after freeze,then open the lid and slightly twist and twist,the tray will release the ice easily. 【Upgraded Food-grade Material】：Our ice cube trays and ice box are made of high quality food-grade PP. BPA free, no smell, no toxic. Stronger, drop-resistant,safety & durable. Upgraded materials and designs to make the ice trays stronger and more durable. 【Convenient Usage Design】：Just fill with enough water and close the lid to squeeze out excess water, over-filling the tray pass the indentation line guarantees perfectly round ice balls,no need to fill hole by hole, Then place mold in the freezer for 4-6 hours, you can get 1 tray x 33pcs perfect sphere ice balls.(3 trays can produce 99pcs balls at one time) 【Wide Application】：Besides water, you can fill the ice cube trays silicone with fruits, ice cream, soda, cocktail, whisky, vodka, ice coffee, and wine to customize your favorite flavor.Great for home use, parties and bars etc. 【Ice Cube Tray with Bin & Scoop】：Each ice cube maker set comes with 3 trays(2 blue & 1 pink), one Ice bin(easy to storage ice) and a scoop(It's more clean to take ice). This Ice cube set is perfect for party & Gathering.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jk9iJKa2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Witwar","source_asin":"B0BXC8L1KV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-374081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXC8L1KV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXC8L1KV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
