window.products.push({"id":374266,"name":"MANSNIX Motorized Blinds with Valance Remote Control Upgraded Smart Blackout Roller Shades Electric Automatic Window Blinds for Windows Blinds & Shade","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":81.25,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l9XVaYgoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[\"Alexa,turn off the blinds in the study\"]:Easily control shades with a button press,tap on your mobile device automatically,or even with your voice(when integrated with a compatible smart-home system).Simple,easy to use voice controls via Siri,Alexa or the Google Assistant.Accessibility for All,motorized blinds can benefit the elderly and physically disabled.Choosing smart roll shade can really liberate your hands and let you enjoy the scientific and technological life. [SMART WITH A BRIDGE]:The Smart Bridge is how we deliver the best possible smart shade experience to you.We offer a cheaper hub for full smart functionality.With the Smart Bridge pairing new devices is as simple as pressing a button.When the Wi-Fi goes down,your scenes and schedules don’t miss a beat,and you’ll still be in control of your shades with Remotes.Remote basic program is factory set before ship.Everyday Removable battery is the power source to your cordless roller blind. [BEAUTIFUL SHADES MOVING TO YOUR SCHEDULE]:Schedule shades to automatically close whenever you want.Schedule shades to raise and lower to prevent harsh summer rays from heating interiors up or to prevent heat loss in the winter.Easily give your home a lived-in look while you're away by scheduling shades to automatically raise and lower at set times.Blinds will know how to work effectively,to maintain temperature and lower energy costs,along with remote control.Saving your life time. [FREE RETURNS&ADVANCED MATERIAL]:We offer you 100% money back guarantee to ensure your 100% satisfaction.If you are not completely satisfied with blackout roller shades,PLS contact us directly by the name of the store below the Purchase button.We will respond ASAP.Fabrics look better for longer,UV protection energy saving thermal insulated.The roller window shades blackout offer complete privacy and light blockage,perfect for media rooms,nurseries,and bedrooms. [MEASUREMENT&INSTALLATION]:For detailed instruction,please watch video or picture instruction on the last part of image section.Inside and outside can be install as well.For inside mount,min install depth is 1.8 inches.In case of very thin,bay or almost no-frame windows,please consider Outside Mount.OUTSIDE MOUNT:Plus at least 4\" is blind width.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l9XVaYgoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MANSNIX","source_asin":"B0B5WXYHX2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-374266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5WXYHX2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5WXYHX2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
