window.products.push({"id":374335,"name":"The Magic Is In You 3\" Black Onyx Raven (Crow) - Hand Carved Spirit Animal Totem","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91QkSF91ihL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Each piece of genuine Black Onyx has been carved into the shape of a Raven that 3\" tall, by 1 & 1/2\" wide, by over 1 & 1/4\" thick. Eye colors may vary. Each Spirit Animal comes individually packaged with a description card that provides a complete description of the healing properties of the stone. Also included with every crystal order are detailed instructions on how to program and cleanse your stones. About the Raven:  Ravens are very intelligent birds who can mimic various sounds, including human words. The Raven Spirit brings change in consciousness, self-knowledge, & introspection. It helps with transformation & traveling between other dimensions.About Onyx: Onyx centers and aligns your energy in order to access higher guidance. It imparts self-control, balances the dualities within the self, and helps you to make wise decisions. Onyx promotes vitality and determination. It can help you to view the future and encourages you to become the master of your own destiny.Onyx provides strength and support, especially during times of difficulty, confusion, and/or mental or physical stress. It relieves overwhelming fears and worries, imparts self-confidence, promotes comfort within your surroundings, and helps with learning lessons. Onyx absorbs healing energies from the universe. It can be used for past-life work in order to heal old grief and sorrows, and/or old injuries and physical trauma that may be affecting the present life. Physically, Onyx is beneficial for teeth, bones, bone marrow, blood, and feet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91QkSF91ihL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Magic Is In You","source_asin":"B07D2JS3PT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-374335","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D2JS3PT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D2JS3PT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
