window.products.push({"id":374369,"name":"Nearly Natural 5402 6.5ft. Deluxe Ficus Tree,Green,48x48x78","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ukKahGOML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A pure explosion of forest green - that's exactly what this beautiful Ficus tree personifies. With several straight stalks that shoot upwards, it provides the ideal backdrop for the absolute burst of leaves that inhabit them (more than 2500 in all.) Plus, these leaves do not need water or sun to stay green, so your Ficus tree will stay beautiful-looking for years to come. Makes a great gift as well as an ideal home or office decoration. Silk arrangements are manufactured using synthetic materials, such as polyester material or plastic, and are well designed and constructed to be life-like in appearance. This item may need to be re-shaped when removed from the secure box to allow it to reach its fullest size. Your tree will look beautiful for years to come; simply wipe clean with a soft dry cloth when needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ukKahGOML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nearly Natural","source_asin":"B0BWL94MF1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-374369","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWL94MF1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWL94MF1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
