window.products.push({"id":374403,"name":"Naomi Home Foldable Metal Platform Bed Frame with Tool Free Setup, Twin Bed Frame, 14 Inches High, Platform Bed Frame Twin Size, Twin Bed Frame No Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sGH54HlqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A ONE-AND-DONE SOLUTION: Why buy both a bed frame and box spring for your twin size mattress? Our sturdy steel twin bed frame lets you enjoy the benefits of both; and fear not - this hardworking bed frame twin size only requires opposable thumbs to set-up. NO BOX SPRING NEEDED: Platform bed frame twin size is made with heavy steel that replaces your box spring, allowing you to rest your memory foam or spring mattress directly on top; legs have plastic caps to protect your floors. UNDERBED STORAGE: Total of 13 inches of clearance space under the twin bedframe provides valuable storage room for extra odds and ends. QUICK, TOOL-FREE SETUP: Shipped in one compact box and with intuitive and tool-free one touch setup; rest your mattress directly on top of the bed frames twin size platform; single Twin size bed frame supports a maximum weight capacity of 750 lbs, while other sizes up to 1500 lbs. QUALITY MATERIAL: Made with heavy-duty steel provides a supportive foundation for any mattress. Suitable for small spaces, perfect for apartments and dorm rooms, and offers under-bed storage space to keep your room organized with our twin bed frame. Our Metal bed frame come with a 90 Day Manufacturer's Warranty, and in the unlikely event that you are not satisfied with our bed frame, you can contact our customer service for a return/refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sGH54HlqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Naomi Home","source_asin":"B09YB3XKC4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-374403","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YB3XKC4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YB3XKC4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":374404,"name":"Admired By Nature Artificial Spring Mixed Flower 11 stem Peony Bush, ABN1B013-BT","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.14,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TeTMbSnDL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Beautiful Stems and flower bulbs of high quality combination artificial dahlia, morning glory and ranunculus and blossom fillers mixed bush. The beautiful hued petals adorn each lush bloom creates a cozy ambiance that's sure to bring colors and style to your home all throughout the year. A backdrop of greens complements perfectly to this lavishing bunch. Dimensions based on image shown. Primping required to match on the image shown.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TeTMbSnDL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Admired By Nature","source_asin":"B096WYW8ZP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-374404","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096WYW8ZP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096WYW8ZP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":374405,"name":"Chef Craft Select Squeeze Bottles with Cap, 6 Ounces, Clear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CtHMZkLhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Impress your friends with homemade sauces at your next barbecue. Chef Craft's squeeze bottles allow the same easy to serve style as store bought condiments, while allowing you to put your own spin on the classics. Use these squeeze bottle your next chicken nugget or taco party! Each package contains 2 squeeze bottles. The bottle is 6.75 inches in height. It has a 6 ounce capacity, great size for traveling. Consists of safe, BPA free plastic. Dishwasher safe for easy cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CtHMZkLhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chef Craft","source_asin":"B073PRCJ88","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-374405","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073PRCJ88","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073PRCJ88","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":374406,"name":"Table Cloths Rectangle 60 x 84 Polyester Fabric Table Cloth for Oval or Oblong Kitchen Table Cover for Dining Table Washable Easy Care Gray Tablecloth","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Rx0gwn+oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RECTANGULAR 6 - 8 seats Farmhouse Tablecloth, ideal table cloth for oval and rectangle dining table. Measure your table (length & width) and add at least 6 inches to each side to get minimum size of fabric table cover required. POLYESTER Material weighing 194gsm which means a heavyweight, quality fabric that is hard wearing. Being POLYESTER, the tablecloth is machine washable and doesn't crease significantly, is silky to touch and drapes easily. This TIMELESS CLASSIC stripe table cloth design can be taken outdoors for a completely casual lunch, or dressed and used as a Formal New Year Eve Table Cloth. This Classical stripe design will never date, and instantly creates an inviting table setting for family gatherings, in a kitchenette or large country kitchen. This stylish dining table covering would also make a wonderful present, as part of a wedding registry, or even a Silver Wedding Anniversary present. A Tablecloth is an essential decorative accessory, that unites all the components of a table setting, it insulates and protects the table & lowers the noise level in the room. Color is a design tool that changes the mood of the table setting without having to change the tableware. Available in Navy Blue or Gray with White Stripes and White with Black Stripes. Table Linen is the safest defense against germs. We are very confident that you'll love this tablecloth, but if you are not in any way happy with your purchase, we'll gladly refund you. ***TABLECLOTH TIP*** To create a super smooth look with a warm iron, set the ironing board up close to the end of the table and pull the ironed tablecloth over the table as the creases are ironed out! You'll Love This Great Tablecloth!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Rx0gwn+oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Table & Trends","source_asin":"B085TKQDTS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-374406","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085TKQDTS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085TKQDTS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
