window.products.push({"id":374493,"name":"Qtisky Set of 5 Halloween Creepy Cloth Decoration, Black Scary Halloween Gauze Cloth(72 x 30 in), Spooky Cloth Tapestry for Halloween Party Supplies D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Zrz0xT8zL._AC_SL1486_.jpg","description":"👻★【PERFECT SIZE】: The Halloween Creepy Cloth measures 30 inch wide and 72 inch long. Large enough to be decorated at Halloween parties. Five cloths are included so that you can decorate it anywhere. The gauze looks great when draped over doors, windows, couches, tables, chairs, and more desired places. 👻★【ELASTIC & SOFT MATERIAL】: The Spooky Halloween Cloth is made of high-quality soft cotton with elasticity. Therefore, the cloth is easy to hang and shape, and can be stretched at your will. Soft material makes sure that you can better adjust the web cloth. Durable and convenient to use. 👻★【DESIGN BY YOURSELF】: Easy to cut and design, you can pair it with some fake spiders or other decorations, or use scissors to cut and tear holes in the cloth to make creepy designs. Then, cut it into strips and hang them from your light fixtures to create a truly creepy lighting effect for horror scenes. 👻★【APPLICABLE OCCASIONS】: Not only perfect for Halloween Party Decoration, but also can be applied for Bars, Karaoke, Shopping mall, Ghost-theme parties. Apart from indoor Halloween decoration, the gauze cloth can also be decorated outdoors. 👻★【PACKAGE INCLUDED】: Five Halloween Creepy Cloths are included so that you can decorate anywhere you want without worrying that the cloth is not enough. You can also match and mix these cloths with other decorations. An indispensable decoration for your Halloween!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Zrz0xT8zL._AC_SL1486_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qtisky","source_asin":"B09QSMNM7P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-374493","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QSMNM7P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QSMNM7P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":374494,"name":"Automatic Foaming Soap Dispenser - Seawah 304 Stainless Steel Rechargeable Touchless Hand Free soap Dispenser Pump with Adjustable Foam - 9.5oz Smart ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RdeUjoVuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Touchless&SUS304】: Our automatic soap dispenser features an upgraded infrared sensor that generates foam in 0.2 seconds, without touching, for a more hygienic and convenient handwashing experience. The high-grade 304 stainless steel housing has an advanced baking paint process, making it easy to clean and resistant to oil and dirt,and with anti-rust and anti-corrosion function, the service life is longer. 【Adjustable foam amount by distance】: With our newly upgraded sensors, you can adjust the amount of foam without buttons. When your hand is within 0-3 cm of the sensor, you'll get 0.6 grams of foam, and when it's within 3-7 cm, you'll get 1 gram of foam, achieving true touchless operation. 【Type-C charging port】: Our automatic touchless soap dispenser has a built-in 1300 mA rechargeable battery, providing long-lasting use for up to 3 months on a single charge,you'll never have to worry about frequent battery replacements, saving you both money and time. 【Compatible with various soaps】: Our automatic foam soap dispenser can be used with different soaps, making it versatile and easy to use. Simply mix ordinary liquid soap with water in a 1:4-6 ratio to get the perfect foam. Foam soap can be added directly for even greater convenience. 【IPX5 waterproof rating】: Our automatic soap dispenser has an IPX5 waterproof rating, making it easy to clean with water and allowing it to withstand a variety of wet environments. This provides an added layer of protection for the longevity of the product. 【Strong after-sales service】: We provide 12 months of after-sales service for our automatic soap dispenser, with free exchange services available within the warranty period. You can use it with confidence and peace of mind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RdeUjoVuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seawah","source_asin":"B0C5MXMLTD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-374494","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5MXMLTD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5MXMLTD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
