window.products.push({"id":374547,"name":"Peugeot Tahiti 6 Inch Pepper Mill, White Matte","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yPO6b7tnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Advantage of Freshly Ground Spices There are many benefits to freshly grinding pepper, salt, herbs and spices for cooking and seasoning. A quality mill with a specifically designed grinding mechanism will release the aromas and essential oils of that spice. Freshly ground pepper and spices have more aroma and better flavor than pre- ground. Another advantage of using freshly ground spices or minerals (salts) is the control a mill provides for determining the coarseness (size) of a grind. A high quality pepper, salt or spice mill gives you the ability to choose and change the coarseness according to taste or necessity. How to Choose a Good Mill When looking for a pepper, salt or spice grinder, consider the following: Grinding mechanism: Choose a grinding mechanism that can withstand daily use: one that is well made and produces a consistent grind. Ideally, the grinding mechanism should be designed to handle a specific spice, as each spice has different physical characteristics that will benefit from different design features. Design and appearance: Whether it's traditional or modern, manual or electric, a mill can be an indispensable tool in your kitchen and a beautiful part of table decor. Ease of Use: A quality mill should be easy to adjust, easy to fill, and feel comfortable in the hand. History of Peugeot Peugeot's story starts in the 19th century when the Peugeot brothers converted the family's gristmill into a steel foundry. They began producing award winning hand tools immediately after opening and went on to produce a diverse range of exceptional quality products including small appliances, bicycles and most notably, automobiles. (Although now operating as a separate company, the Peugeot car company continues the same commitment to quality and innovation that is a Peugeot hallmark). In 1840 Peugeot created their burr style coffee grinder and adopted that design to accommodate peppercorns in 1874. The resulting pepper mechanism design is still used today in every Peugeot pepper mill. Peugeot's iconic pepper grinding mechanism design is often copied, but never equaled. Today, Peugeot offers six unique spice-specific mechanisms plus the original burr-style coffee grinder. There are no shortcuts: each mechanism is designed to get the most out of the spices they are intended for. After more than 160 years, Peugeot mills and grinders remain the benchmark of the industry and have earned their position as the mill of choice in world class kitchens. It's All About the Mechanism The primary difference between Peugeot and all other brands are the spice-specific mechanisms. Peugeot has 7 unique spice specific mechanisms for pepper, salt, herbs and spices, coffee, wet salt, chili peppers and nutmeg. For each spice, there is one - and only one - Peugeot grinding mechanism, each made of the ideal design and constructed from the best material available for its intended use. All Peugeot mechanisms are made in France and carry a lifetime limited warranty. Peugeot's Pepper Grinding Mechanism is a two stage burr-style system. During production, the helix-shaped grooves and grinding teeth of the pepper mechanism are individually cut before the steel is case hardened to make it virtually indestructible. The mechanism is then given a proprietary treatment to provide additional protection against corrosion. During use, the helix- shaped grooves guide whole peppercorns through the mechanism to crack, then grind to a consistent size by a double row of teeth. This process releases the pepper's essential oils, resulting in more flavor and aroma for your dish. This patented mechanism is found on every Peugeot Pepper mill and is widely considered the best pepper mechanism available Peugeot's Salt Crushing Mechanism features two ribbed plates which work to fracture and crush coarse, dry sea salt to a consistent size. The salt grinding mechanism is made of corrosion resistant Stainless Steel, and is found on every Peugeot Salt Mill. Peugeot's Spice Mechanism is made of ceramic, and is specially designed to grind dried spices and flat leafy herbs to release their essential oils. It is particularly effective with dried aromatic herbs such as thyme, parsley, basil, oregano, and herbs de Provence, as well as dried seeds such as cumin. Peugeot's Chili Pepper Mechanism is made of case hardened steel for optimal hardness and resilience. This patented mechanism features a pre-cutting system and dual chamber reservoir. For use with dry, hot chilis such as birds tongue, African devils and Piri Piri. The Nutmeg Shaving Mechanism is made of treated stainless steel which is corrosion resistant, and offers superior edge retention. The Peugeot nutmeg shaver is equipped with a double stainless steel grater blade and a strong claw which enables the whole nutmeg to be very finely shaved, while keeping fingers safe. Intended for use with whole nutmeg nuts. Peugeot's Wet Salt mechanism has been specially designed for wet sea salt: a spiral guides the ","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yPO6b7tnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peugeot","source_asin":"B001AXY76Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-374547","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001AXY76Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001AXY76Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":374548,"name":"Tribesigns 5-Tier Tall Bookshelf with 2 Cabinets, 70.8 inches White and Gold Etagere Bookcase, Free Standing Opening Metal Storage Bookshelves for Dis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":209.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811kGNdu0ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Massive Storage Space: Overall Dimension: 23.6\"L x 11.8\"W x 31.5\"H.The unique design of this 5-tier bookshelf makes it powerful for storage.5 levels of open shelves can store and display such as books, artwork, ornaments, and framed photos. The lower 2 cabinets are a hidden storage area that creates a convenient spot to keep out of sights such as documents, clothing, and food. Modern Design: This elegant bookcase with shelving will have any room in your home feeling luxurious and chic. Easy to integrate personality into the home. Dress up a living room, study room, hallway, bedroom, or office with the elegant design of this contemporary metal bookshelf. Built to Last: The gold bookcase is sturdy and long-lasting with superior particleboard and thick square metal tube. The advanced paint process makes the metal part of the coating color uniform. The unique vertical stems enhance stability and add a geometrical aesthetic feeling. Stable and Secure: Every good book or cherished decoration needs reliable support. Each shelf of the open bookcase can support up to 80 lbs. Adjustable feet offer no wobbling standing. Purchase with Confidence: With a simple structure and detailed instructions, you'll have it assembled before you know it. Tribesigns provides an 18-month warranty and professional customer service before and after purchase. Don't wait any longer and enjoy it now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811kGNdu0ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tribesigns","source_asin":"B0BHQSPPK9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-374548","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHQSPPK9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHQSPPK9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":374549,"name":"Revolution Tea - Mesh Infuser Full Leaf Tea - Tropical Green Tea - 20 Bags - 6 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HA-ScnUwL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"With pineapple, lemon verbena, and orange peel, take yourself to the beach in your mind with a sweet, fruity twist. Beneath the fruit flavors, find the high-quality flavor of Dragonwell and Young Hyson teas, with their delicious and deep flavors. GREEN TEA | One intriguing substance it contains is an amino acid called L-theanine. It has been shown to improve brain function, and it works synergistically with the small amount of caffeine in green tea. Contains 20 mg of caffeine. OUR REVOLUTION | We only offer full leaf teas, select herbs, real fruit, essential oils and all natural flavors. Never tea fanning's and dust. We introduced the first infuser tea bag which allows tea to flow freely and brings more flavor to the cup. THE INFUSER | Revolution started a full-scale uprising, overthrowing the paper tea bag in favor of the first flow-through Infuser bag. The Infuser marries the full-leaf flavor of loose tea with the convenience of a bag, a match made in tea heaven. QUALITY | The best tea is usually grown at higher elevations, often on steep slopes, so it must be hand picked in the traditional, time-consuming way. This is why all of Revolution's ingredients are hand-picked and grown at higher elevations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HA-ScnUwL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Revolution Tea","source_asin":"B09CZFLLZZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-374549","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CZFLLZZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CZFLLZZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
