window.products.push({"id":374736,"name":"HULISEN Cutlery Serrated Food Chopper, 3 Inch Stainless Steel Manual Hand Chopper with Grip Handle & Serrated Tooth Edge, Handheld Chopper, Chop Cabba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UXCIT8yXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgrade Wide Grip Handle - Save More Effort: Design with non-slip wide grip handle that is ergonomically designed to help you chop egg salad easier and faster without worrying about hand and wrist fatigue. Save more effort than wooden or metal handle. Wide handle is comfortable to hold and keeps fingers out of harms High Grade Material - Sturdy & Durable: Made of sturdy stainless steel, rustproof, easy to clean and dishwasher safe. High quality material making them strong so they keep their shape, long lasting and durable. Thick handle with four rivets on one side which make them not easy to bend and not deformed Simple & Efficient - Easy to Mix and Chop: With sturdy stainless steel serrated tooth edge and blades, easily chopping egg, nut, tuna, cabbage, potato, onions, ground beef, coleslaw, vegetable in small for salad. Chopping pecans and walnuts quickly for baking. Or chop frozen strawberries, avocado for dessert. Or anything that needs to be roughly chopped. No cord to drag out, no appliance to clean, simple efficient kitchen gadget, just chop down with a twisting motion, make your prep job easier Perfect Size: Stainless steel blade measures 3-inch diameter, large enough to contact more food, tall handle for deeper foods like melon, the handle is long enough to avoid your hand touching the food Easy to Clean & Store: HULISEN chopper with non-stick surface, just rinse with water then you can get rid of the remain ground beef and egg , also dishwasher safe. Easy to store, you can store this small kitchen tool in the drawer for space-saving. It could be as gift for your family or friends to make cooking much easier and wonderful","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UXCIT8yXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HULISEN","source_asin":"B09Z2FHVJ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-374736","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z2FHVJ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z2FHVJ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":374737,"name":"Hocupoma Tv Stand for 55+ Inch/ 65 Inch Tv Console with Storage Drawers Mid Century Wood Rustic Retro Universal Tv Stands for Bedroom Living Room Barn","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":249.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZtPH2IpaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"First, Measure the size of the TV: the most common sizes are 32\"*(27.9\"*15.7\"), 40\"(34.9\"*19.6\"), 43\" (37.5\"*21.1\"), 50\" (43.6\"*24.5 \"), 55\" (47.9\"*27\"), 65\" (56.7\"*31.9\"), 70'' (61\"*34.3\") and 75\" (65.4\"*36.8\"). Sizes: 32\", 40\", 43\", 50\" and 55\" best for bedroom, guest room or kitchen, Sizes: 65\", 70\" and 75\" best for living room or medium-sized rooms. Second,Choose TV Stand Length: Generally, the length of the TV cabinet is longer than the length of the TV, which can protect the TV. Also pay attention to the size of the TV wall, as well as design options, such as the space occupied by vases or aromatherapy machines. Third,Choose TV Stand Width: Most TV cabinets are between 5.5\"-6\" wide.A few have narrow or wider. Fourth, Choose TV Stand Height: Keep the TV and the sofa at an appropriate distance: 32\"-4.5ft(D), 40\"-5.8ft(D), 43\"-6.0ft(D), 50\"-7.0ft(D), 55\" -77.7ft(D), 65\"-9.1ft(D), 70\"-9.8ft(D) and 75\"-10.5ft(D). Viewers sit at a distance where the screen fills up about 30°of their field of vision for good viewing comfort; The height of the sofa will also affect the size. Fifth,Choose material and style: The TV cabinet is made of high quality 15mm MDF with a lifespan of 10+ years and a maximum load capacity of 110 lbs. The TV cabinet can hold a lot of things, saving a lot of space for coffee tables and side tables. It's also important to match the style of the TV cabinet with the furniture. Assembly is required, and assembly instructions and tools are included.Product Size:L*W*H 59\"* 15.75\"*28\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZtPH2IpaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BD1MZS37","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-374737","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD1MZS37","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD1MZS37","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
